$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Ruhland, Thomas; Bang, Kia S.; Andersen, Kim
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2002), 67(15), 5257-5268

