C-S cross-coupling reactions and the sequential indium-mediated
allylation and allenylation reactions (Table 4) Reaction with
4-iodobenzaldehyde (4c) (Table 4, entry 3, 5c) : Pale yellow oil.
1H-NMR(400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.52 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 2H), 7.34 (d, J = 8.1 Hz,
2H), 5.14-5.12 (m, 1H), 4.92 (qd, J = 3.1, 2.9 Hz, 2H), 2.21 (d, J = 4.1
Hz, 1H), 1.58 (t, J = 3.1 Hz, 3H), 1.28 (s, 9H); 13C-NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3)
δ 204.7, 142.4, 137.4, 132.0, 126.7, 102.5, 78.0, 74.3, 45.9, 30.9, 14.5;
IR (Neat) 3399, 3073, 2960, 2897, 2960, 2713, 1959, 1596, 1486, 1363,
